# Vercel uploads the repo root (web build needs apps/web + packages/*). Keep the
# upload lean — Vercel does not reliably honor nested .gitignore, so the 2.1GB
# Rust build tree below was getting swept in and aborting the upload. Only
# exclude things the web build never needs; leave packages/* dist intact.
**/target
apps/desktop
.claude
.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
